      "message": "Yes, IIRC, both `\u003creg\u003e` and `\u003cranges\u003e` in `/pci` describe CPU address regions and must therefore contribute to the \"set\" this function is tracking. Note that, unlike `\u003creg\u003e`, `\u003cranges\u003e` is even less robustly defined so we\u0027ll also have to parse it on a per-`device_type` basis.",
