      "message": "This doesn\u0027t really work because it conflates all the `\u003creg\u003e` into the same address space, which is wrong if there exist multiple \"buses\" in the DT. In our case, `platform.dts` uses `\u003creg\u003e` for CPUs, which aren\u0027t actual physical addresses; filtering by `device_type` might be enough for us, right now.",
